
@host = http://localhost:5224

### 1. Login (send this first)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@gezana.local", "password": "Manager@123" }

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### List amenities (note the ids)
GET {{host}}/api/amenities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List room types
GET {{host}}/api/room-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one room type
GET {{host}}/api/room-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a room type
POST {{host}}/api/room-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Family",
  "description": "Two connected rooms for families",
  "bedType": "Twin",
  "bedCount": 3,
  "sizeSqm": 45,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "maxChildren": 2,
  "viewType": "Garden",
  "smokingAllowed": false,
  "baseRate": 4000,
  "amenityIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### Edit a room type (change the 4 to the id you got when adding)
PUT {{host}}/api/room-types/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Family",
  "description": "Two connected rooms for families, with a balcony",
  "bedType": "Twin",
  "bedCount": 3,
  "sizeSqm": 48,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "maxChildren": 2,
  "viewType": "Garden",
  "smokingAllowed": false,
  "baseRate": 4500,
  "amenityIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}

### Delete a room type
DELETE {{host}}/api/room-types/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== AMENITIES =====

### Add an amenity (expect 200)
POST {{host}}/api/amenities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Air conditioning", "category": "Room" }

### Add it again (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/amenities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Air conditioning", "category": "Room" }

### Edit it (use the id from the first request)
PUT {{host}}/api/amenities/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Air conditioning", "category": "Comfort" }

### Delete it (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/amenities/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== PROPERTIES =====

### List properties (expect Gezana Demo Hotel with roomCount 8)
GET {{host}}/api/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a property
POST {{host}}/api/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "gdh2", "name": "Gezana Lakeside", "address": "Bishoftu, Ethiopia", "isActive": true }

### ===== ROOMS =====

### List all rooms
GET {{host}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter: property 1, status Clean
GET {{host}}/api/rooms?propertyId=1&status=Clean
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter: Deluxe rooms only (room type 2)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms?roomTypeId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Count of rooms per status
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a room
POST {{host}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "propertyId": 1, "roomTypeId": 2, "roomNo": "204", "floor": 2 }

### Mark a room Dirty (use the id of room 204 from the add above)
PATCH {{host}}/api/rooms/9/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Dirty" }

### Try to set Occupied by hand (expect 400)
PATCH {{host}}/api/rooms/9/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Occupied" }

### Delete the new room
DELETE {{host}}/api/rooms/9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Try to delete property 1 (expect 409, it has rooms)
DELETE {{host}}/api/properties/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== RATE PLANS =====

### List plans (expect Room Only with one rule, and Bed & Breakfast)
GET {{host}}/api/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a plan
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Half Board", "mealPlan": "HalfBoard", "price": 700, "validFrom": "2026-01-01", "validTo": "2030-12-31" }

### Same name again (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Half Board", "mealPlan": "HalfBoard", "price": 700, "validFrom": "2026-01-01", "validTo": "2030-12-31" }

### Dates the wrong way round (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Broken", "mealPlan": "None", "price": 0, "validFrom": "2030-12-31", "validTo": "2026-01-01" }

### Edit the plan (use the id from the add; 3 is likely)
PUT {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Half Board", "mealPlan": "HalfBoard", "price": 750, "validFrom": "2026-01-01", "validTo": "2030-12-31" }

### ===== RATE RULES =====

### Long-stay discount: 7+ nights, 10% off
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "LengthOfStay", "minNights": 7, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": -10 }

### Weekend increase: 15% more
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "Weekend", "minNights": 1, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": 15 }

### Seasonal fixed extra: +200 per night in December
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "Seasonal", "minNights": 1, "adjustmentType": "Fixed", "adjustmentValue": 200, "validFrom": "2026-12-01", "validTo": "2026-12-31" }

### Percent too big (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "LengthOfStay", "minNights": 7, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": -150 }

### Max nights smaller than min nights (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "LengthOfStay", "minNights": 7, "maxNights": 3, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": -5 }

### Seasonal rule without dates (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "Seasonal", "minNights": 1, "adjustmentType": "Fixed", "adjustmentValue": 100 }

### Unknown rule type (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "Banana", "minNights": 1, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": 5 }

### Edit a rule (use the id of the long-stay rule you added; 2 is likely): make it 14+ nights, 15% off
PUT {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "LengthOfStay", "minNights": 14, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": -15 }

### Delete that rule (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3/rules/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete the Half Board plan (expect 204, its remaining rules go with it)
DELETE {{host}}/api/rate-plans/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== GUESTS =====

### Add a guest (expect 201)
POST {{host}}/api/guests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Abebe Kebede", "phone": "+251911000111", "email": "abebe@example.com" }

### Same guest again (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/guests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "abebe kebede", "phone": "+251911000111" }

### Bad email (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/guests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test Guest", "phone": "+251911000222", "email": "not-an-email" }

### Empty name (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/guests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "", "phone": "+251911000333" }

### Add a second guest, with no email
POST {{host}}/api/guests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Tigist Haile", "phone": "+251922000444" }

### Search by name (expect Abebe only)
GET {{host}}/api/guests?q=abebe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by phone
GET {{host}}/api/guests?q=922
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List all, 1 per page (expect items: 1, total: 2)
GET {{host}}/api/guests?page=1&pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one guest (use the id from your add; 1 is likely)
GET {{host}}/api/guests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit the guest
PUT {{host}}/api/guests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Abebe Kebede", "phone": "+251911000111", "email": "abebe.kebede@example.com" }

### ===== ID DOCUMENTS =====

### Add a national ID (response shows a masked number)
POST {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "NationalId", "idNumber": "ET1234567890", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia", "expiryDate": "2032-05-01" }

### Same ID again (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/guests/2/id-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "NationalId", "idNumber": "ET1234567890", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia" }

### Unknown ID type (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "Library card", "idNumber": "L-001", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia" }

### Add an expired passport (saved, but isExpired is true)
POST {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "Passport", "idNumber": "EP1234567", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia", "expiryDate": "2020-01-01" }

### Verify the national ID (use its id; 1 is likely): expect isVerified true, verifiedByName "Hotel Manager"
POST {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents/1/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify the expired passport (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents/2/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the ID number: verification should be cancelled (isVerified false)
PUT {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idType": "NationalId", "idNumber": "ET1234567891", "issuingCountry": "Ethiopia", "expiryDate": "2032-05-01" }

### The guest detail shows both documents with masked numbers
GET {{host}}/api/guests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete the passport (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/guests/1/id-documents/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete the second guest (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/guests/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== RATE QUOTES =====

### Standard + Room Only, 3 weekday nights (expect 1500 per night, total 4500)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Standard + Bed & Breakfast, 3 nights (expect 1800 per night, total 5400)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=2&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deluxe + Room Only, 6 nights (no long-stay discount: expect 2500 per night, total 15000)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=2&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deluxe + Room Only, 7 nights (10% off: expect 2250 per night, total 15750)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=2&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Suite + Bed & Breakfast, 7 nights (that plan has no rules: 5300 per night, total 37100)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=3&ratePlanId=2&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check-out before check-in (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-05&checkOut=2026-12-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Same day (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-05&checkOut=2026-12-05
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing dates (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown room type (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=99&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Outside the plan's valid dates (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2031-01-01&checkOut=2031-01-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Longer than 365 nights (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2028-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== STACKING RULES (adds two temporary rules to Room Only) =====

### Add a weekend rule: +15%
# @name addWeekend
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/1/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "Weekend", "minNights": 1, "adjustmentType": "Percent", "adjustmentValue": 15 }

### Add a seasonal rule: +200 per night in December 2026
# @name addSeasonal
POST {{host}}/api/rate-plans/1/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ruleType": "Seasonal", "minNights": 1, "adjustmentType": "Fixed", "adjustmentValue": 200, "validFrom": "2026-12-01", "validTo": "2026-12-31" }

### Standard + Room Only, 7 nights, 1 to 8 December: expect total 11255, average 1607.86
### (weekday nights 1550, Friday and Saturday nights 1752.50; look at appliedRules in each night)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Same plan, 6 nights, 1 to 7 December: expect total 10650, average 1775 (no long-stay discount)
GET {{host}}/api/rates/quote?roomTypeId=1&ratePlanId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clean up: delete the two test rules (expect 204 each)
DELETE {{host}}/api/rate-plans/1/rules/{{addWeekend.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/rate-plans/1/rules/{{addSeasonal.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== AVAILABILITY =====

### No bookings in these dates (expect Standard: total 4, reserved 0, available 4)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10 to 11 Dec: only TEST-001 overlaps (Standard: reserved 2, available 2)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-10&checkOut=2026-12-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12 to 13 Dec: TEST-001 and TEST-002 overlap (Standard: reserved 3, available 1)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-12&checkOut=2026-12-13
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13 to 14 Dec: TEST-001 checks out on the 13th, so only TEST-002 overlaps (reserved 1, available 3)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-13&checkOut=2026-12-14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9 to 10 Dec: back to back with TEST-001, so no overlap (reserved 0, available 4)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-09&checkOut=2026-12-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### With prices, Room Only, 7 nights 1 to 8 Dec (expect Standard total 9450, Deluxe 15750, Suite 31500)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-08&ratePlanId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3 adults: only the Suite fits (maxAdults 4)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04&adults=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3 children: nothing fits (expect an empty roomTypes list)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04&children=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Zero adults (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04&adults=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wrong dates (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-05&checkOut=2026-12-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing dates (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown property (expect 404 with a message)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=99&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown rate plan (expect 404 with a message)
GET {{host}}/api/availability?propertyId=1&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04&ratePlanId=99
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

